          "type": "creator_note",
          "id": "res-calc-note-001",
          "title": "Differential Calculus & Extrema Theorems",
          "snippet": "When f''(c) = 0, the second derivative test fails. Inspect sign changes in f'(x)."
        },
        "isRead": true,
        "readAt": "2026-08-28T10:00:00.000Z",
